/-!
# Chern classes and sections: Stacks 0FA9 for the total Chern class

Let `(S, δ)` be the base situation of chapter 42 of the Stacks Project, let `X` be a scheme
locally of finite type over `S`, let `ℰ` be a finite locally free `𝒪_X`-module, let `f : X' ⟶ X`
be locally of finite type and let `s ∈ Γ(X', f^*ℰ)`. The *zero scheme* `Z(s) ⊆ X'` is the closed
subscheme whose quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals is the image of `s : (f^*ℰ)^∨ ⟶ 𝒪_{X'}`
(`Stacks.RegularSectionSequence.zeroScheme`).

[Stacks, Tag 0FA9] says: if `dim_δ(X') = n`, if `f^*ℰ` has constant rank `r`, if
`dim_δ(Z(s)) ≤ n - r`, and if for every generic point `ξ ∈ Z(s)` with `δ(ξ) = n - r` the ideal
of `Z(s)` in `𝒪_{X', ξ}` is generated by a regular sequence of length `r`, then

  `c_r(ℰ) ∩ [X']_n = [Z(s)]_{n - r}`  in  `CH_*(X')`.

The rank of `ℰ` itself need not be constant, and `c_r(ℰ) ∈ A^r(X)` is the degree-`r` component of
the total Chern class `Stacks.Chow.totalChernOfFiniteLocallyFree` of [Stacks, Tag 0ESW]. Because it
is a bivariant class, its cap product on `X'` is `c_r(f^*ℰ) ∩ -`
(`Stacks.Chow.op_totalChernOfFiniteLocallyFree_of_rank`), and the statement is the case `X = X'`
(`Stacks.Chow.chernCap_cap_fundamentalCycle_eq_zeroScheme`), proved by induction on `r` over the
projective space bundle of `f^*ℰ`.

## Main results

* `Stacks.Chow.totalChernOfFiniteLocallyFree_cap_fundamentalCycle_eq_zeroSchemeCycle` —
  **[Stacks, Tag 0FA9]**.

## Implementation notes

The hypothesis `dim_δ(X') = n` of the source is weakened to `dim_δ(X') ≤ n`; the proof uses
nothing more.

The cap product of `c_r(ℰ)` against the Chow group of `X'` is the cap operation of the bivariant
class at `f`, transported from `X ×_X X'` to `X'` along the base-change isomorphism, as the
defining conditions of a bivariant class require.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 0FA9](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0FA9)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0FA8](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0FA8)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0ESW](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0ESW)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0B7H](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0B7H)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

open AlgebraicGeometry CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits TopologicalSpace

universe u

namespace Stacks.Chow

/-- **[Stacks, Tag 0FA9].** Let `(S, δ)` be the base situation of chapter 42, let `X` be locally
of finite type over `S`, let `ℰ` be a finite locally free `𝒪_X`-module, let `f : X' ⟶ X` be
locally of finite type such that `f^*ℰ` has constant rank `r`, and let `s ∈ Γ(X', f^*ℰ)`. Assume
`dim_δ(X') ≤ n`, that `dim_δ(Z(s)) ≤ n - r`, and that for every generic point `ξ ∈ Z(s)` with
`δ(ξ) = n - r` the ideal of `Z(s)` in `𝒪_{X', ξ}` is generated by a regular sequence of length
`r`. Then

  `c_r(ℰ) ∩ [X']_n = [Z(s)]_{n - r}`  in  `CH_{n - r}(X')`,

where `c_r(ℰ) ∈ A^r(X)` is the degree-`r` component of the total Chern class
`Stacks.Chow.totalChernOfFiniteLocallyFree` and `c_r(ℰ) ∩ -` is its cap operation on the test
scheme `f`. -/
@[stacks 0FA9 "c_r(E) cap [X']_n = [Z(s)]_{n-r} for E finite locally free on X with f^*E of \
constant rank r on X', c_r(E) the degree-r component of the Chern class of Tag 0ESW capped on \
the test scheme f, and with dim X' at most n."]
theorem totalChernOfFiniteLocallyFree_cap_fundamentalCycle_eq_zeroSchemeCycle
    (C : ChowSituation.{u}) {X X' : Scheme.{u}} (sX : X ⟶ C.S) [LocallyOfFiniteType sX]
    (E : X.Modules) [AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.IsFiniteLocallyFree.{u, u, u} E] (r : ℕ)
    (f : X' ⟶ X) [LocallyOfFiniteType f]
    [AlgebraicGeometry.SheafOfModules.IsFiniteLocallyFreeOfRank.{u, u, u}
      ((Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj E) r]
    (s : Γ((Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj E, ⊤)) (n : ℤ)
    (hX' : schemeDeltaDimension C (f ≫ sX) ≤ (n : EInt))
    (hZ : schemeDeltaDimension C
        ((RegularSectionSequence.zeroScheme X' ((Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj E) s).subschemeι ≫
          (f ≫ sX)) ≤
      ((n - (r : ℤ) : ℤ) : EInt))
    (hreg : IsRegularSequenceOnZeroScheme C (f ≫ sX) ((Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj E) s r
      (n - (r : ℤ))) :
    chowPushforwardOfIso C (pullback.fst (𝟙 X) f ≫ sX) (f ≫ sX) (identityBaseChangeIso f).hom
        (identityBaseChangeIso_hom_comp_base C sX f) (n - (r : ℤ))
        ((totalChernOfFiniteLocallyFree C sX E r).cap f n
          (QuotientAddGroup.mk' (rationalEquivalences C (f ≫ sX) n)
            (cycleAssociatedToClosedSubscheme C (f ≫ sX) (𝟙 X') n))) =
      QuotientAddGroup.mk' (rationalEquivalences C (f ≫ sX) (n - (r : ℤ)))
        (cycleAssociatedToClosedSubscheme C (f ≫ sX)
          (RegularSectionSequence.zeroScheme X' ((Scheme.Modules.pullback f).obj E) s).subschemeι
          (n - (r : ℤ))) := by
  have key := DFunLike.congr_fun (congrFun (congrFun
    (op_totalChernOfFiniteLocallyFree_of_rank C sX E f r) n) r)
    (QuotientAddGroup.mk' (rationalEquivalences C (f ≫ sX) n)
      (cycleAssociatedToClosedSubscheme C (f ≫ sX) (𝟙 X') n))
  rw [GenuineChern.chernFamily, chernCapFamilyOnChow_of_le _ _ _ _ _ _ le_rfl] at key
  exact key.trans (chernCap_cap_fundamentalCycle_eq_zeroScheme C (f ≫ sX) _ r s n hX' hZ hreg)

end Stacks.Chow

end
